msgid "“Apply without confirmation” skips the automatic rollback. If the new address is wrong, the device may become unreachable."
msgstr "“不确认，直接应用”会跳过自动回滚。如果新地址有误，设备可能无法访问。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/smartnetpilot/smartnetpilot.js:2012
